From fb957ec717ac20320c8bb3157291073e78cce924 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 18:45:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): a new document reaches the Setups page to create its
 first setup

The browser's Setups row was drawn only once a setup existed, and the
ribbon had no way to the Setups page, so a fresh document could never
reach "Create first setup". The row now stands whenever the Setup
section is open, and the ribbon's Setup group opens on a Setups cell
(the existing workholding glyph) that targets the page. Creating the
first setup stays the undoable CreateSetup command.

Shell snapshots regenerated: the Setups ribbon cell (the bar re-spaced)
and the Setups browser row are the only changes.

Fixes #322

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
